080031AC palette-update-return

Palette_ApplyFrame exits through r0, leaving 080031C9.
The three previous-state stores use r1 and preserve r0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/palette_controller.c
+++ b/src/palette_controller.c
@@ -438,4 +438,7 @@
     t->previousBrightness = t->brightness;
     p->previousState = gSunClock.state;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return 0x080031C9; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
